Polyfork DSL Lab
================

This repository contains an independent declarative DSL, its runtime, a viewer,
and example graphs. It does not contain, link to, download, or redistribute any
Polyfork source code, asset files, GLB/USD/FBX conversions, or kit archives.

Polyfork and its catalogue are the work of their author and are governed by
https://polyfork.dev/licensing. No affiliation with or endorsement by Polyfork
is claimed.

Some example graphs are independent re-expressions/ports of publicly observable
Polyfork constructions, included for demonstration and interoperability testing
(fair-use research/demo). They are written in this project's DSL, contain no
Polyfork source text, and are not redistributed Polyfork files. Geometric parity
is measured order-independently and is not a byte-identical reproduction claim.
Other examples are clearly marked original studies.

If you use Polyfork assets, obtain them from Polyfork under their terms. Do not
use this repository to redistribute their source or as a commercial asset
generator without the appropriate permission.
